{"type":"message","id":"0a2ae677","parentId":"79c3b751","timestamp":"2026-06-15T07:14:37.986Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_dKCFpzjo6Ift9lXxLL2I0649","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"    # 加载持仓（从 Binance API 同步真实持仓）\n    log.info(\"🔄 从 Binance API 同步持仓...\")\n    try:\n        api_positions = get_all_positions()\n        # 如果 API 返回空，尝试从本地文件加载\n        if not api_positions:\n            log.warning(\"⚠️ Binance API 返回空持仓，尝试从本地文件加载...\")\n            positions = load_positions()\n            if positions:\n                log.info(f\"✅ 从本地文件恢复 {len(positions)} 个持仓\")\n            else:\n                positions = []\n                log.warning(\"⚠️ 本地文件也无持仓，初始化为空\")\n        else:\n            # 2026-03-28 老公指示：先加载本地缓存，保留止盈止损\n            old_positions = load_positions()\n            log.info(f'📊 加载本地缓存 {len(old_positions)} 个持仓用于保留止盈止损')\n            \n            # 过滤有实际持仓的币种\n            positions = []\n            for p in api_positions:\n                amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：过滤粉尘仓位（名义价值<$5 不纳入）\n                if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:\n                    # 转换为本地格式\n                    symbol = p['symbol']\n                    # 2026-03-30 老公指示：用新百分比重新计算止盈止损（4%/2%）\n                    entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                    direction = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                    tp_sl = calc_tp_sl(entry, direction, {}, {})  # 重新计算，不保留旧缓存\n                    \n                    pos = {\n                        'symbol': symbol,\n                        'type': direction,\n                        'entry_price': entry,\n                        'entry_time': datetime.now().isoformat(),\n                        'qty': abs(amt),\n                        'amount': abs(amt),\n                        'score': 55,\n                        'regime': 'trending',\n                        'ai_result': None,\n                        'order_result': {'success': True, 'message': '从 API 同步'},\n                        'high_24h': 0.0,\n                        'low_24h': 0.0,\n                        'tp1_price': tp_sl['tp1_price'],\n                        'sl_price': tp_sl['sl_price'],\n                        'peak_pnl': 0.0,\n                        'tp_pct': tp_sl.get('tp_pct', 0.04),\n                    }\n                    positions.append(pos)\n                    log.info(f\"✅ 同步持仓：{symbol} {pos['type']} @ ${pos['entry_price']:.2f}\")\n        save_positions(positions)\n        log.info(f\"✅ 持仓同步完成：{len(positions)}个\")\n        \n        # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：启动时清理不属于任何持仓的孤儿 Algo 条件单\n        if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n            position_symbols = {p.get('symbol', '') for p in positions}\n            try:\n                all_algos = request(\"GET\", \"/fapi/v1/openAlgoOrders\", {})\n\n[543 more lines in file. Use offset=2320 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781507677966}}
{"type":"message","id":"66d325d8","parentId":"0a2ae677","timestamp":"2026-06-15T07:14:42.761Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue clearly. At line 2279-2280, when the API returns positions, the code:\n\n1. Loads old local cache (`old_positions = load_positions()`)  \n2. Creates new `positions` list from API data only\n3. Saves the new `positions` list (line 2312)\n\nThis looks correct - it should overwrite the cache with API data. But the problem might be in the main trading loop, not at startup. Let me look at the main loop around line 2390-2640 where `save_positions` is called repeatedly.\n\nLet me also check area ~2396-2425 where `api_positions` is consulted during the main loop.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_00_6FZwnIUERyUowYXhAt9L0237","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/crypto_signal_monitor.py","limit":80,"offset":2390}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":750,"output":394,"cacheRead":53632,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54776,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1781507677993}}
{"type":"message","id":"06d4b784","parentId":"66d325d8","timestamp":"2026-06-15T07:14:42.840Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_00_6FZwnIUERyUowYXhAt9L0237","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"            log.warning(f\"⚠️ 爆仓保护检查失败：{e}\")\n\n        # 每 20 个 tick（5 分钟）从 API 同步持仓\n        # 🐛 Bug 修复：API 是真相，本地是缓存。API 返回 0 说明真的没有持仓\n        if scheduler.tick % 20 == 0:\n            try:\n                api_positions = get_all_positions()\n                # 🐛 Bug 修复：API 返回 dict 表示错误，保留缓存不处理\n                if isinstance(api_positions, dict) and 'error' in api_positions:\n                    log.warning(f\"⚠️ API 查询失败，保留本地缓存：{api_positions['error'][:50]}\")\n                    api_count = -1  # 标记失败\n                else:\n                    # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：过滤粉尘仓位（名义价值<$5），防止误重建\n                    api_count = sum(1 for p in api_positions \n                        if float(p.get('amount', 0)) != 0\n                        and abs(float(p.get('amount', 0))) * float(p.get('entry_price', 0)) >= 5.0)\n                \n                # 判断是否需要重建持仓：计数变化 OR 方向变化\n                need_rebuild = False\n                \n                if api_count == 0:\n                    if len(positions) > 0:\n                        log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：API 持仓=0，清空本地缓存（原{len(positions)}个）\")\n                        # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：清空持仓时同步取消 Binance 上所有残留 Algo 条件单\n                        if AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n                            for old_pos in positions:\n                                try:\n                                    cancel_algo_orders(f\"{old_pos['symbol']}USDT\")\n                                except Exception:\n                                    pass\n                        positions = []\n                        save_positions(positions)\n                        log.info(\"✅ 持仓同步完成：0 个（API 为空）\")\n                elif api_count > 0 and api_count != len(positions):\n                    need_rebuild = True\n                    log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：本地{len(positions)}个 → API{api_count}个\")\n                elif api_count > 0 and api_count == len(positions) and api_count > 0:\n                    # 🐛 仓位反转检测：计数相同但方向不同时也要重建\n                    for p in api_positions:\n                        amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                        entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                        if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:  # 🔧 过滤粉尘\n                            sym = p['symbol']\n                            api_dir = 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG'\n                            for lp in positions:\n                                if lp['symbol'] == sym and lp['type'] != api_dir:\n                                    need_rebuild = True\n                                    log.info(f\"🔄 持仓同步：{sym} 方向变化 {lp['type']}→{api_dir}，强制重建\")\n                                    break\n                            if need_rebuild:\n                                break\n                \n                if need_rebuild:\n                    new_positions = []\n                    for p in api_positions:\n                        amt = float(p.get('amount', 0))\n                        entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                        # 🔧 2026-06-06 修复：过滤粉尘仓位（名义价值<$5 不重建）\n                        if amt != 0 and abs(amt) * entry >= 5.0:\n                            symbol = p['symbol']\n                            entry = float(p.get('entry_price', 0))\n                            # 🐛 修复：反转重建持仓时按风控规则重算数量，不用 API 的 abs(amt)\n                            size_pct = CONFIG[\"position_size_pct\"]\n                            expected_qty = (CONFIG[\"total_capital\"] * size_pct * 10) / entry\n                            correct_amount = format_quantity(symbol, expected_qty, entry)\n                            api_amount = abs(amt)\n                            size_ratio = api_amount / correct_amount if correct_amount > 0 else 1.0\n                            log.info(f\"🔧 反转重建 {symbol}：API原始={api_amount:.4f} → 风控标准={correct_amount:.4f} (比例={size_ratio:.1%})\")\n                            \n                            # 🔧 2026-06-10 修复：API 持仓量严重偏小（<80%风控标准）→ 迷你仓位，关闭后用标准量重开\n                            if size_ratio < 0.8 and AUTO_TRADE_ENABLED:\n                                log.warning(f\"⚠️ {symbol} 迷你仓位检测：API={api_amount:.4f} < 标准80%，尝试修复\")\n                                try:\n                                    # 构造临时持仓对象，复用 close_position 的完整降级逻辑\n                                    tmp_pos = {\n                                        'symbol': symbol, 'type': 'SHORT' if amt < 0 else 'LONG',\n                                        'entry_price': entry, 'amount': api_amount, 'qty': api_amount,\n                                        'tp1_price': 0, 'sl_price': 0, 'tp1_hit': False,\n                                        'size_remaining': 1.0, 'tp_pct': 0.04, 'peak_pnl': 0.0,\n                                    }\n\n[393 more lines in file. Use offset=2470 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1781507682828}}
{"type":"message","id":"033e959d","parentId":"06d4b784","timestamp":"2026-06-15T07:14:53.329Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I see the issue! Look at lines 2390-2426:\n\nThe code syncs positions every 20 ticks (5 minutes). It checks:\n1. If API returns 0 positions → clears local cache ✅\n2. If API count differs from local count → needs rebuild ✅  \n3. If API count == local count → only checks for direction reversal\n\nThe problem is: **if `api_count == len(positions)`** (say both are 5), it only checks for direction reversals. It does NOT check if the API has DIFFERENT symbols than the local cache.\n\nSo here's the bug scenario:\n1. Local cache has 5 positions: SOL, ETH, BNB, XRP, LINK\n2. SOL gets closed externally, new position opens (e.g., different coin)\n3. API now has 5 positions too (just different set)\n4. Count matches (5 == 5), so the code only checks direction reversal\n5. It doesn't detect that SOL and ETH are missing from the API\n6. Stale positions remain in cache forever\n\nThis is the bug! The sync logic should also check for symbol-level mismatches (which symbols are in API vs local), not just count and direction.\n\nLet me verify by looking at the condition at line 2428:\n\n```python\nelif api_count > 0 and api_count == len(positions) and api_count > 0:\n    # 🐛 仓位反转检测：计数相同但方向不同时也要重建\n    for p in api_positions:\n        ...\n```\n\nYes! This is the bug. When positions count matches but the symbols are different, the code only checks for direction reversal within existing positions, not for missing/extra symbols.\n\nSo the fix is to also check for symbol-level mismatches, or more simply, to always sync from API data rather than trying to be clever about partial updates.\n\nLet me tell the husband what the bug is and propose a fix.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了，在 `crypto_signal_monitor.py` 的持仓同步逻辑里。\n\n**Bug 位置：第 2428-2446 行**\n\n每 5 分钟做一次 API 同步时，逻辑是这样的：\n- API 持仓数 ≠ 本地缓存数 → 重建 ✅\n- API 持仓数 == 本地缓存数 → **只检查方向反转**，不检查币种是否还是同一组 ❌\n\n所以当 SOL 被手动平掉后，如果恰好有新单替补进来（总持仓数没变，还是比如5个），代码就认为\"数量一致、方向没反转，不用动\"，僵尸 SOL 和 ETH 数据就永远留在缓存里了。\n\n**修复方案：** 在数量一致的判断分支里，补一条币种集合比对——只要 API 和本地缓存的币种集合不一致，就触发重建。\n\n要我修吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1306,"output":1002,"cacheRead":54528,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":56836,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781507682852}}
