{"type":"message","id":"ea3bc2ef","parentId":"94e1c762","timestamp":"2026-06-15T07:29:54.238Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Both files compile fine. Let me summarize the changes:\n\n1. `crypto_signal_monitor.py` - Added symbol-set comparison in the position sync logic (every 5 min). Now when API count == local count but the symbols differ, it triggers a rebuild. This catches zombie cache entries.\n\n2. `manual_trade.py` - After successfully closing a position, it now removes the symbol from `crypto_positions.json` local cache. This eliminates the 5-minute window where stale data persists.\n\nNow the husband needs to restart (kj) for the monitor fix to take effect.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"两处语法都过了。改了两个文件：\n\n**1. `crypto_signal_monitor.py`** — 持仓同步逻辑\n每 5 分钟同步时，增加币种集合比对：计数相同但币种变了 → 强制重建缓存，不再只靠方向反转检测。\n\n**2. `manual_trade.py`** — 手动平仓后清理\n平仓成功后，从 `crypto_positions.json` 里删掉该币种，消除 5 分钟窗口期的脏数据。\n\n重启生效：`kj`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":31,"output":359,"cacheRead":61696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":62086,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781508586468}}
