{"type":"message","id":"0ffd8c39","parentId":"12430607","timestamp":"2026-06-15T16:04:57.081Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"OK so I can see:\n\n1. **Mobile SL/TP IS running** - XRP 止损 was updated multiple times (1.2558 → 1.2571 → 1.2576), and 止盈 was restored at 1.2879. This confirms the trailing SL/TP is active.\n\n2. **Binance Testnet issues are back** - Around midnight (00:00-00:04), there are massive SSL errors and timeouts from testnet.binancefuture.com. K线重试, positionRisk failing, price API failing, fear & greed index failing.\n\nLet me also check the broader context to see how long this has been going on and whether earlier today the TP/SL updates were consistent.\n\nLet me just give a clear answer: yes, the trailing SL/TP is running (evidenced by XRP updates), but Binance Testnet is having SSL issues again at midnight.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"在跑的 👑\n\nXRP 止损一直在更新：\n- 23:54 `1.2558 → 1.2571`\n- 23:59 `1.2571 → 1.2576`\n- 止盈保持在 `1.2879`\n\n移动止盈止损正常推进中。\n\n不过币安测试网又开始抽风了——刚过零点就开始疯狂 SSL 超时，K线、持仓查询都受影响。这是测试网自己的毛病，不影响已挂的 Algo 单执行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":1789,"output":493,"cacheRead":72192,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":74474,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781539485202}}
