{"type":"message","id":"eaded763","parentId":"01289d77","timestamp":"2026-06-15T16:07:55.407Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"BNB SHORT was opened around when BNB LONG TP was hit at 21:23:55. It must have been the monitor's reversal logic - the previous BNB LONG was closed at TP (~633), and then the monitor opened a BNB SHORT.\n\nNow let me give a clean summary. The positions are:\n- SOL LONG (+5.97, +2.99%) - SL actively trailing ✅\n- BNB SHORT (+1.56, +0.75%) - entered around 21:23, newer\n- LINK LONG (+1.83, +0.91%) - entered at 21:19, newer\n\nFor BNB SHORT and LINK LONG: they're newer positions (~3 hours old), and the price movement hasn't been dramatic enough to trigger frequent SL trailing. BNB SHORT is barely in profit territory and LINK LONG is also in modest profit. Their SL will update as price moves further into profit.\n\nMeanwhile SOL LONG (+2.99%) has been running longer and the price moved significantly → frequent SL updates as the trailing mechanism kicks in.\n\nAlso, note that XRP position is gone, and BNB flipped from LONG to SHORT after TP hit.\n\nLet me give a concise answer.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"现在 3 个持仓，逐个说：\n\n| 币种 | 方向 | 盈亏 | SL 移动 |\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\n| ⚡ SOL | LONG | +5.97 (+2.99%) | ✅ 频繁更新中，71.48 → 74.49 |\n| 🔶 BNB | SHORT | +1.56 (+0.75%) | ⏸️ 暂未触发移动 |\n| 🔗 LINK | LONG | +1.83 (+0.91%) | ⏸️ 暂未触发移动 |\n\nSOL 赚多了一直在跟，没问题。BNB 和 LINK 是今晚 21 点后才开的新仓（BNB 是前一个多单止盈后反转开的空），盈利幅度还不够大，还没触发移动止盈——这是正常的，系统按三档触发，利润没到第一档不会动。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"deepseek","model":"deepseek-v4-pro","usage":{"input":116,"output":707,"cacheRead":79872,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80695,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1781539666547}}
